Cell["\<\
Encodes the interaction-net duplication\[Dash]annihilation law: when a copy \
meets its co-copy head-on, both disappear and their legs join pairwise.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"39d3141d-7d3b-4c82-9bed-823c559acaed"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"bd2b95cd-9d7b-47d6-b583-56a7139399fa"],

